# Diagnosis response schema

Use the `Diagnosis` Pydantic model as `response_format` so the LLM response is returned as that schema.

When defining the schema, set `Field(description=...)` on each field so the LLM can read what the field means.

```python
class Diagnosis(BaseModel):
    """Structured diagnosis returned by the model."""

    code_bug_found: bool = Field(description="True when a code bug was found.")
    file_path: str | None = Field(
        description="Repository path of the cause, or None when no file is blamed."
    )
```
